---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Portfolio — Landscape & Hardscape Projects"
description: "See the range of Research Turf Management's work across Central Texas — pergolas, patios, masonry, native plantings, flower beds, sod & full landscape transformations."
---
{% import "partials/icons.njk" as ico %}
{% import "partials/photo.njk" as photo %}

{% set projects = [
  { label: "Lawn & Turf Care", icon: "grass", image: "lawn", blurb: "Healthy, established turf with the consistent care it takes to stay that way." },
  { label: "Garden Maintenance", icon: "leaf", image: "garden", blurb: "Thoughtful pruning and care for planted spaces that feel finished." },
  { label: "Outdoor Living", icon: "wall", image: "outdoor", blurb: "Garden spaces designed for lingering outside." },
  { label: "Landscape Care", icon: "tree", image: "care", blurb: "Practical, dependable care for the whole landscape." }
] %}

<section class="hero hero--page">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero__inner">
      <p class="hero__tagline">Our work</p>
      <h1>From bare lots to backyards you never want to leave</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">Pergolas, patios, masonry, native plantings and full landscape transformations across Central Texas. Here's the range of what we build.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact/">Start Your Project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="wrap crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Portfolio</nav>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      {% for p in projects %}
      <figure style="margin:0">
        <div class="media" style="aspect-ratio:1/1">
          {{ photo.image(p.image, p.label + " landscape project") }}
          <span class="media__label">{{ p.label }}</span>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="muted" style="font-size:.92rem;padding:12px 4px 0">{{ p.blurb }}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="card center" style="margin-top:40px;max-width:760px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">
      <h3>Want to see photos of a specific project type?</h3>
      <p class="muted">We're building out our project gallery with real before-and-afters from Central Texas homes. In the meantime, give us a call — we're happy to walk you through similar projects we've completed near you.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Request Project Examples</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">In their words</p>
      <h2>The work our customers describe</h2>
      <p class="lead">Our best portfolio is what long-time customers say we've built for them:</p>
      <blockquote class="review" style="font-style:italic">"Pergola, extending the patio, masonry work on the front porch and flower beds, tree trimming, plus regular lawn care."<br><span class="review__context" style="font-style:normal">— Judy Buck, 13+ year customer</span></blockquote>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Every project includes</h3>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span>A free, on-site design consultation</span></li>
          <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span>One crew from design through build</span></li>
          <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span>Licensed, insured &amp; warranty-backed work</span></li>
          <li>{{ ico.svg("check") }} <span>Water-wise, Hays-County-appropriate design</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set ctaHeading = "Have a project in mind?" %}
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
